# A whitelist, like 12tails-video's: everything at the top level is ignored unless it is listed here.
# Untracked by design: wardrobe/data (built from the game rips, moved between PCs by pipeline/transfer_to_drive.ps1),
# wardrobe_dist (the published copy, rebuilt by pipeline/wardrobe_publish.py), checks/, tto_config/, .superpowers/.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/CLAUDE.md
!/NOTES.md
!/wardrobe.cmd
!/pipeline/
!/plans/
!/wardrobe/
# every data folder, also one renamed aside (data_old, data-home, ...): 300 MB of game data never goes into git
/wardrobe/data*/
__pycache__/
